#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:72
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Hello, caravaneer.\n\nI have an offer for you, which would eclipse the career of any adventurer! Meet me in Murmurwoods, inside circle of stones. Won't trust more details to paper.\nI will be there *any time* you will decide to come, but even it is against code of our organization, I plead, do not delay too long.\n\nV."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:73
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Hello, nobles.\n\nI have an offer for you, which would eclipse the fate of any hero! Meet me in empty tower of Clancer's laborathory in Tularean forest. Won't trust more details to paper.\nI will be there *any time* you will decide to come, but even it is against code of our organization, I plead, do not delay too long.\n\nV."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:74
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Hello, adventurers.\n\nI have an offer for you, which would eclipse the fate of any hero! Meet me in Abdul's Resort in Dragonsand. Won't trust more details to paper.\nI will be near pedestal there *any time* you will decide to come, but even it is against code of our organization, I plead, do not delay too long.\n\nV."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:76
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Fellow journeman!\n\nNoble Lord Markham organizes a grandiose match on the Emerald island!\nTake your chance to enter the pantheon of the nobles, winning the right to rule the famous castle Harmondale and all it's neighborhoods!\n\nBoats from Steadwick shipping Emerald Island each wednesday, while contest is on the way.\n\n\n\n"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:84
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SCROLL.TXT.py:2
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " Greetings,  Years ago, in a previous war, the Elves stole an artifact from us during a raid.  They've managed to hide this artifact away since, but now they've decided to move it into the Tularean Caves for safekeeping.  We've sent a raiding party of our own to get the artifact from them before they're able to get it in the caves.  I would ask that you assist our forces in assuring the artifact's return.  Thank you,  Ellen Rockway"
msgstr "\nПриветствую,\n\nМного лет назад, во время предыдущей войны, в одном из набегов эльфы украли у нас артефакт. С того времени им удавалось прятать его, но сейчас они решили поместить его в Тулареанские пещеры, чтобы обеспечить его безопасное хранение.  Мы послали свой отряд, чтобы отбить у них артефакт до того, как они поместят его в пещеры.  Я хотел бы обратиться к вам с просьбой помочь нашим войскам вернуть артефакт.\n\nСпасибо,\n\nЭллен Роквей"

