msgid "With Grand Master Earth Magic you can learn the Grand Master spell for this element.\nHigher level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nGrand Master Earth Magic can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Earth Magic, and can pay the price of 8000 gold."
